# Speech Basic v2.7 (C64): its keywords and tokens, from petcat (VICE 3.7.1): petcat -wspeech.
# Use it in a BASIC file with: tokenfile speech-basic-v2-7
# BASIC V2's keywords are here too, so the longest keyword that matches is the one taken.
# Left out, as they're only symbols (so * stays BASIC V2's multiply): <-

